    "title": "Coding Courses by TripleTen",
    "description": "Make your first steps to a career in tech with Tripleten learning platform. Download the app, take a career quiz and meet new tech professions with 10-h demo courses.\r\n\r\nTripleten is an international coding bootcamp, part-time and fully online. We help people choose their future career and come to it, from scratch to real employment.\r\n\r\nAnd we're pretty good at it:\r\n\r\n- Tripleten is recognised as the best coding bootcamp in the USA\r\n- 78% of more than 5000 Tripleten graduates found a tech job within 3 months after graduation\r\n\r\nWith this mobile app you will be able to:\r\n\r\n- Learn more about different career paths\r\n- Try out Tripleten's learning platform for free\r\n- Try yourself in one of the IT professions, or all of them\r\n- Write your first code right in your smartphone\r\n\r\nGo ahead and join thousands of Tripleten students worldwide. It's never been easier to start your way into tech.",
